// Scheduled VC4 sink input for the image_boxblur_shared hardware test.
//
// The cooperative block stages a 12 x 16 clamped input tile into shared VPM:
// each of the 12 resident warps writes one halo row and three x-shifted row
// vectors, then all warps synchronize through the four-semaphore block barrier.
// Warps 0..9 read the staged VPM rows for their output row and compute the
// canonical rounded 3x3 low-8-bit box blur for a 10 x 14 tile.
